  title="Small Text for Social Media: Instagram, TikTok, Twitter/X &amp; More"
  description="Complete guide to using small text on Instagram, TikTok, Twitter/X, and other social platforms. Style comparisons, character limits, bio examples, platform-specific rendering, and tips to maximize engagement."
